# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw source 3D models — deliberately excluded (55 MB combined).
#
# Both are trademarked production vehicles with no license documentation in
# this repository. gowatt/src/three/Car.tsx now loads the Tesla Model 3 (at
# the project owner's explicit direction, after being told the trademark/
# licensing risk in plain terms — see gowatt/README.md, "The car model," for
# the full record) — but it loads the COMPRESSED derivative committed under
# gowatt/public/models/, not this raw 22 MB source file. The BYD Dolphin is
# still entirely unused. Excluding these two raw files just keeps 55 MB of
# redundant/unused binaries out of git history, where they can't easily be
# removed later — it is not a statement that the compressed derivative is
# any safer to ship than the source it came from.
#
# To include them anyway, delete the two lines below and commit. Consider
# `git lfs track "*.glb"` first.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
2021_byd_dolphin_ev.glb
tesla_2018_model_3.glb
